{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9c4b2f6a-7d31-42b8-9a52-rekapan-narsum-tsi",
    "name": "API Rekapan Narsum TSI",
    "description": "Collection CRUD API Rekapan Narsum TSI (Bun + Elysia + PostgreSQL).\n\n**Alur auth**\n1. Jalankan `Auth > POST /login` (username & password default: admin / admin).\n2. Test script menyimpan `data.token` ke variable `token`.\n3. Semua request admin memakai header `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\n\nFolder: **Auth**, **User** (tanpa token), **Admin** (token), **System**.\nJalankan **Collection Runner** dengan urutan Auth -> User -> Admin -> System untuk cek semua status code.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "admin"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "admin"
    },
    {
      "key": "id",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ada token JWT', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.token.split('.').length).to.eql(3);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('tokenType Bearer', () => pm.expect(body.data.tokenType).to.eql('Bearer'));",
                  "pm.test('ada expiresAt', () => pm.expect(new Date(body.data.expiresAt).getTime()).to.be.above(Date.now()));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.token);",
                  "console.log('token disimpan ke variable {{token}}');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Login admin. Default kredensial: admin / admin (lihat ADMIN_USERNAME & ADMIN_PASSWORD di .env). Response berisi JWT yang otomatis disimpan ke variable {{token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /login - password salah",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('pesan sesuai', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.include('salah'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"password-salah\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Test negatif: password salah harus ditolak 401."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /login - field kosong",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('ada errors[]', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().errors).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Test negatif: password tidak dikirim harus 422 dengan daftar error per field."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /me - cek token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('role admin', () => pm.expect(body.data.role).to.eql('admin'));",
                  "pm.test('ada expiresAt', () => pm.expect(body.data.expiresAt).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["me"]
            },
            "description": "Memastikan token di variable {{token}} masih valid dan menampilkan waktu kedaluwarsanya."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User (tanpa token)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET / - daftar data publik",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('response berupa array', () => pm.expect(Array.isArray(body)).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('key sesuai template', () => {",
                  "  if (!body.length) return;",
                  "  pm.expect(Object.keys(body[0])).to.eql(['id','Nama','Instansi','Topik','Tanggal Mulai','Tanggal Selesai','Lokasi','Mode Pelaksanaan']);",
                  "});",
                  "if (body.length) pm.collectionVariables.set('id', body[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Mengembalikan array seluruh data rekapan narasumber tanpa autentikasi (99 baris hasil seed)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
